{"ref":"BDB, אֲבִיאָסָף","hw":"אֲבִיאָסָף","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיאָסָף</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my father has gathered</em><strong>)</strong> son (descendant) of Korah <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:24\" href=\"/Exodus.6.24\">Ex 6:24</a>, Sam. <span dir=\"rtl\">אביסף</span>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיָסָף</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.8\">1 Ch 6:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.19\">9:19</a> (cf. Nes<sup>Eg 185</sup>).","next":"BDB, אֲבִיגַ֫יִל","prev":"BDB, אֲבִיאֵל"}